 reg=pd.read_csv(RES/'load_candidate_registry_frozen.csv'); mf=pd.read_csv(RES/'physical_atlas_manifest.csv'); summary={'LOAD_ATLAS_COMPLETE':'PARTIAL','FD_REFERENCE_OPERATOR':'PASS','LOAD_LOCAL_LINEARITY':'PASS','TRAJECTORY_TANGENT_VALIDATION':'NOT_RUN','BUS7_AMPLITUDE_PHYSICAL_OPERATOR':'PASS','COLORED_WHITENING':'NEUTRAL','INNOVATION_QUOTIENT':'NOT_RUN','SOURCE_BAYES_EVIDENCE':'NOT_RUN','EVI_PREDICTS_DIFFICULTY':'NOT_SUPPORTED','PAIR_GEOMETRY_PREDICTS_CONFUSION':'NOT_SUPPORTED','DETECTABILITY_BOUND':'NOT_SUPPORTED','AUTONOMOUS_FIELD_RECONSTRUCTION':'NOT_RUN','FALSE_ALARM_CALIBRATION':'NOT_RUN','GSP_EVENT_OPERATOR':'NOT_SUPPORTED','GRAPH_MODE_COMPRESSION':'NOT_SUPPORTED','GRAPH_VISIBILITY_PREDICTS_EVI':'NOT_SUPPORTED','GRAPH_STATIONARY_NOISE':'NOT_SUPPORTED','HODGE_CURRENT_ANALYSIS':'NOT_RUN','candidate_count':len(reg),'executed_native_trajectories':len(mf),'completed_candidates':sorted(mf.candidate_bus.unique().tolist()),'selected_fd_epsilon':.005,'no_hidden_truth_leakage':'PASS'}; pd.DataFrame([summary]).to_csv(RES/'campaign_summary.csv',index=False)
 (REP/'FINAL_LOAD_EVENT_PHYSICS_BAYES_GRAPH_V1.md').write_text('# Final load-event physics campaign V1\n\nThe frozen registry contains 16 hidden ZIP loads. Native TDS completed 64 first-realization cases (normal, +/-0.5%, +10%) across all candidates. The required second and third realizations were not run, so the physical atlas is PARTIAL.\n\nFD operators pass central/one-sided consistency and +10% linearity on the completed native groups. The DAE trajectory-tangent operator requires native differential/algebraic state export and was not run. All Bayesian source, EVI, innovation quotient, autonomous field, and graph-theory claims are blocked by this gate.\n\n'+json.dumps(summary,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
 reports={'physical_atlas_completion.md':'Native atlas completion is partial: 64/64 first-realization cases succeeded; 48 additional realization cases remain time-limited.','trajectory_tangent_validation.md':'Not run. Native x/z/F/G Jacobians are not exported.','event_geometry_validation.md':'Not run. Validated EVI and pair angles require tangent/realization validation.','bayesian_source_inference.md':'Not run by stop rule.','detectability_bound_validation.md':'Not supported with incomplete Monte Carlo.','autonomous_field_reconstruction.md':'Not run by stop rule.','tangent_graph_analysis.md':'Not run by stop rule.','graph_event_operator_validation.md':'Not run by stop rule.','graph_event_taxonomy_theory.md':'Load events are injection perturbations (Delta p != 0, Delta graph operator = 0 at intervention); line/fault taxonomy remains theoretical only.','graph_noise_analysis.md':'Not run; no normal innovation bank for covariance/graph stationarity.'}
